    {
      "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@23024",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ARCITE.\nAre you not out?\nMeet you no ruin but the soldier in\nThe cranks and turns of Thebes? You did begin\nAs if you met decays of many kinds.\nPerceive you none that do arouse your pity\nBut th’ unconsidered soldier?",
