      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26155",
      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "Valerius!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26155/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6652413,
        "end": 6652447,
        "line": 249648,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap38/p@26155",
        "anchor": "sceneI_38.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": null,
      "attribution": {
        "status": "source-unlabelled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26193",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VALERIUS.\nThe King calls for you; yet be leaden-footed\nTill his great rage be off him. Phœbus, when\nHe broke his whipstock and exclaimed against\nThe horses of the sun, but whispered to\nThe loudness of his fury.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26193/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26193/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 54,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26193/line-3",
          "start": 55,
          "end": 99,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26193/line-4",
          "start": 100,
          "end": 144,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26193/line-5",
          "start": 145,
          "end": 184,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26193/line-6",
          "start": 185,
          "end": 210,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6652451,
        "end": 6652711,
        "line": 249652,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap38/p@26193",
        "anchor": "sceneI_38.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VALERIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26457",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PALAMON.\nSmall winds shake him.\nBut what’s the matter?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26457/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26457/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 31,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26457/line-3",
          "start": 32,
          "end": 54,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6652715,
        "end": 6652804,
        "line": 249661,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap38/p@26457",
        "anchor": "sceneI_38.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PALAMON.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26550",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VALERIUS.\nTheseus, who where he threats appalls, hath sent\nDeadly defiance to him and pronounces\nRuin to Thebes, who is at hand to seal\nThe promise of his wrath.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26550/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26550/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26550/line-3",
          "start": 59,
          "end": 96,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26550/line-4",
          "start": 97,
          "end": 135,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26550/line-5",
          "start": 136,
          "end": 161,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6652808,
        "end": 6653014,
        "line": 249667,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap38/p@26550",
        "anchor": "sceneI_38.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "VALERIUS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26760",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ARCITE.\nLet him approach.\nBut that we fear the gods in him, he brings not\nA jot of terror to us. Yet what man\nThirds his own worth—the case is each of ours—\nWhen that his action’s dregged with mind assured\n’Tis bad he goes about?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26760/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26760/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 25,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26760/line-3",
          "start": 26,
          "end": 73,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26760/line-4",
          "start": 74,
          "end": 109,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26760/line-5",
          "start": 110,
          "end": 156,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26760/line-6",
          "start": 157,
          "end": 205,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@26760/line-7",
          "start": 206,
          "end": 229,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6653018,
        "end": 6653302,
        "line": 249675,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap38/p@26760",
        "anchor": "sceneI_38.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ARCITE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27048",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "PALAMON.\nLeave that unreasoned.\nOur services stand now for Thebes, not Creon.\nYet to be neutral to him were dishonour,\nRebellious to oppose; therefore we must\nWith him stand to the mercy of our fate,\nWho hath bounded our last minute.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27048/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27048/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 31,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27048/line-3",
          "start": 32,
          "end": 77,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27048/line-4",
          "start": 78,
          "end": 118,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27048/line-5",
          "start": 119,
          "end": 158,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27048/line-6",
          "start": 159,
          "end": 199,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27048/line-7",
          "start": 200,
          "end": 233,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6653306,
        "end": 6653594,
        "line": 249685,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap38/p@27048",
        "anchor": "sceneI_38.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "PALAMON.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27340",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ARCITE.\nSo we must.\n[To Valerius.] Is ’t said this war’s afoot? Or, it shall be,\nOn fail of some condition?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
          "tag": "i",
          "start": 21,
          "end": 33
        }
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27340/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27340/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 19,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27340/line-3",
          "start": 20,
          "end": 80,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27340/line-4",
          "start": 81,
          "end": 107,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 6653598,
        "end": 6653752,
        "line": 249695,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap38/p@27340",
        "anchor": "sceneI_38.2"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "ARCITE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27498",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "VALERIUS.\n’Tis in motion;\nThe intelligence of state came in the instant\nWith the defier.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27498/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-two-noble-kinsmen/sceneI_38.2/p@27498/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 25,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
