      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "ARCITE.\nLet th’ event,\nThat never-erring arbitrator, tell us\nWhen we know all ourselves; and let us follow\nThe becking of our chance.",
